WEBVTT

00:51.926 --> 00:53.553
Want to watch a movie while we eat?

00:54.137 --> 00:54.971
Sure.

00:58.725 --> 01:00.268
It smells good.

01:00.351 --> 01:01.311
What should we watch?

01:01.895 --> 01:02.729
Well,

01:02.812 --> 01:03.980
how about a horror movie?

01:04.981 --> 01:06.357
We could watch something else.

01:06.441 --> 01:07.942
Why? You can't watch scary stuff?

01:08.026 --> 01:09.152
BASED ON WEBTOON TRUE BEAUTY
BY YAONGYI

01:09.235 --> 01:12.489
It rained and all, so maybe we can
watch a musical or something.

01:12.572 --> 01:15.658
What? You, the horror comic nerd,
can't watch horror movies?

01:15.742 --> 01:17.827
I already read them as comics every day,

01:17.911 --> 01:19.913
so no need to watch them as movies, right?

01:19.996 --> 01:22.582
It'll be okay.
I'll cover your eyes if you get scared.

01:22.665 --> 01:24.083
I'm not that much of a wimp, okay?

01:24.167 --> 01:26.336
Turn off the lights.
Lights off for horror movies.

01:26.419 --> 01:27.712
There are other interesting…

01:27.796 --> 01:29.547
I'm being such a nuisance

01:29.631 --> 01:31.633
when he's on a date with his girlfriend.

01:37.430 --> 01:38.932
- Here.
- Okay.

02:14.300 --> 02:16.553
Soo-ho is a man, indeed.

02:24.269 --> 02:26.437
You really haven't seen horror films,
have you?

02:26.521 --> 02:28.690
Ghosts don't come out
in these kinds of scenes.

02:38.199 --> 02:39.534
You said they don't come out.

03:36.424 --> 03:37.467
Dad?

03:51.564 --> 03:52.815
That hurts.

03:53.733 --> 03:57.612
Hey, young lady,
how dare you go to a guy's place alone?

03:58.154 --> 04:00.448
I told you I went there to dry off!

04:01.574 --> 04:04.619
Didn't I tell you not to trust
any guys except me?

04:04.702 --> 04:05.912
Mom told me before

04:05.995 --> 04:08.790
that she had a full belly with Hee-kyung
when she got married.

04:10.083 --> 04:11.960
My point exactly.

04:12.043 --> 04:13.586
That's how men are, seriously.

04:13.670 --> 04:15.838
Whatever.

04:15.922 --> 04:18.675
I'm so embarrassed.
How do I see him after this?

04:19.217 --> 04:20.969
You're not helping at all, Dad.

04:21.052 --> 04:21.886
By the way,

04:22.387 --> 04:23.930
don't tell your mom, okay?

04:24.013 --> 04:25.848
That I mooched off of Soo-ho.

04:25.932 --> 04:27.725
Then you keep it a secret from Mom too.

04:27.809 --> 04:29.060
That I'm dating Lee Soo-ho.

04:33.189 --> 04:34.857
You know I'm good
at keeping secrets, right?

04:35.608 --> 04:37.277
You know I'm just like you, right?

04:47.245 --> 04:48.913
- She'll be asleep, right?
- Of course.

04:48.997 --> 04:49.831
She usually is.

05:03.136 --> 05:05.179
- It seems your mom's asleep.
- Let's go in.

05:13.187 --> 05:14.147
Long time no see.

05:15.606 --> 05:16.733
Parade rest.

05:17.317 --> 05:18.151
Attention.

05:19.152 --> 05:20.111
So,

05:20.194 --> 05:22.655
did you catch Columbus Park?

05:23.323 --> 05:24.699
Well…

05:24.782 --> 05:26.242
No.

05:26.326 --> 05:29.370
How dare you try to sneak into my house?

05:29.454 --> 05:31.748
- Wait, honey!
- Mom!

05:31.831 --> 05:34.083
- Honey, hear me out! Please!
- Hold it right there!

05:34.167 --> 05:35.543
I need to explain myself!

05:35.626 --> 05:37.712
- I'm a victim too.
- Mom!

05:37.795 --> 05:40.214
- Honey, wait!
- Get out of my way, Ju-kyung!

05:49.974 --> 05:50.892
Hi.

05:50.975 --> 05:52.226
Did your dad scold you?

05:52.310 --> 05:54.896
More like he got scolded by my mom.

05:55.563 --> 05:56.773
I'm sorry.

05:56.856 --> 05:58.691
My dad totally crashed our date.

05:58.775 --> 05:59.776
Not at all.

05:59.859 --> 06:00.777
I had a good time.

06:01.819 --> 06:03.237
You must be tired. Sleep tight.

06:03.905 --> 06:04.739
Okay.

06:05.364 --> 06:06.199
Good night.

06:06.908 --> 06:07.909
Good night.

06:14.457 --> 06:15.792
Why aren't you hanging up?

06:16.459 --> 06:18.044
You hang up first.

06:18.961 --> 06:19.837
Okay.

06:25.009 --> 06:26.219
Why aren't you hanging up?

06:27.762 --> 06:28.888
I miss you.

06:29.931 --> 06:30.890
Me too.

06:35.186 --> 06:36.896
We'll stay up all night at this rate.

06:36.979 --> 06:37.980
We could do that.

06:59.085 --> 07:00.378
I totally thought that.

07:00.461 --> 07:02.421
- Really?
- It's okay.

07:06.217 --> 07:08.010
Jeez, you really take your sweet time.

07:08.094 --> 07:09.804
You're killing me.

07:09.887 --> 07:12.098
I wonder if Soo-ho felt like this as well.

07:12.598 --> 07:14.475
I should tell everyone soon.

07:17.228 --> 07:18.688
Good morning, Limju!

07:29.282 --> 07:30.658
Sir, here.

07:31.576 --> 07:32.410
Okay.

07:33.077 --> 07:35.705
CAREER INTEREST SURVEY
HANKOOK UNIVERSITY COSMETOLOGY

07:35.788 --> 07:37.039
Are you studying cosmetology?

07:37.123 --> 07:38.458
Not yet.

07:38.541 --> 07:41.294
I literally just have
an interest in the field.

07:42.003 --> 07:43.212
I'm rooting for you.

07:43.713 --> 07:44.964
Thank you, sir.

07:47.425 --> 07:50.386
Mr. Han, are you really dating
that person from the other day?

07:51.053 --> 07:51.888
No,

07:52.555 --> 07:53.639
I'm not dating anyone.

07:53.723 --> 07:54.807
Whatever do you mean?

07:54.891 --> 07:56.767
She said you two were seeing each other!

07:56.851 --> 07:58.102
That person…

07:58.644 --> 07:59.979
She works at Move Entertainment.

08:00.062 --> 08:01.063
- Lim Hee--
- Bread!

08:02.231 --> 08:04.734
Try this bread, would you?

08:10.323 --> 08:12.700
Sorry about that. It just tastes so good.

08:12.783 --> 08:14.744
- What--
- Please have more.

08:14.827 --> 08:15.828
Please take it.

08:22.168 --> 08:23.294
Thank you.

08:23.377 --> 08:25.296
Is your head feeling better now?

08:25.379 --> 08:27.298
I feel better getting some fresh air.

08:27.381 --> 08:28.966
The weather's very nice today.

08:29.967 --> 08:32.720
Right, the clouds are very pretty.

08:36.849 --> 08:37.725
I…

08:40.269 --> 08:41.896
I have something to tell you today.

08:42.730 --> 08:43.564
What is it?

08:44.232 --> 08:46.943
I wanted to tell you
before I tell the others.

08:51.197 --> 08:52.031
Well…

08:53.491 --> 08:55.409
- This--
- I have something to tell you too.

08:56.202 --> 08:58.579
- What?
- It's about what you told me.

08:59.539 --> 09:02.542
You said that you couldn't show your face
because you were worried

09:02.625 --> 09:04.126
that people will turn on you.

09:06.128 --> 09:07.547
I couldn't tell you then,

09:08.464 --> 09:09.966
but I know how that feels.

09:10.758 --> 09:12.051
Did something happen?

09:12.134 --> 09:13.302
To be honest…

09:16.097 --> 09:18.641
my dad hits me sometimes when he's upset.

09:19.809 --> 09:20.643
What?

09:21.435 --> 09:22.562
It's news to you, right?

09:23.312 --> 09:26.440
Pretending that everything's okay
and nothing's wrong…

09:26.524 --> 09:27.900
That's what I do best.

09:29.026 --> 09:29.902
Su-jin.

09:29.986 --> 09:32.071
I thought I hid it pretty well so far,

09:32.863 --> 09:34.407
but Soo-ho knew about it all along.

09:35.157 --> 09:36.450
Soo-ho did?

09:36.534 --> 09:39.412
Now that my mask has shattered before him,

09:40.997 --> 09:42.915
I don't want to bother pretending anymore.

09:43.749 --> 09:46.168
Hiding my feelings,
pretending we're friends…

09:50.464 --> 09:51.757
I like Lee Soo-ho.

09:54.594 --> 09:56.512
So I can't treat him
how I used to anymore.

09:58.347 --> 10:01.684
I'm venting my frustration to you
because you're my best friend.

10:08.357 --> 10:09.942
Why do you look so surprised?

10:10.818 --> 10:11.694
Let's head back in.

10:15.698 --> 10:16.907
Okay.

10:26.417 --> 10:28.252
Hey, Su-jin,

10:28.878 --> 10:29.795
actually…

10:31.839 --> 10:33.299
I'm dating Lee Soo-ho.

10:33.883 --> 10:36.302
- What?
- I thought I should tell you…

10:38.471 --> 10:39.972
You're really dating Lee Soo-ho?

10:41.223 --> 10:42.975
You two were flirting this whole time,

10:43.059 --> 10:44.310
and you never told me about it?

10:44.393 --> 10:46.896
I thought we were best friends.
How could you do this to me?

10:46.979 --> 10:48.981
Had you told me sooner,
I wouldn't have let my feelings grow.

10:49.065 --> 10:51.525
I wasn't trying to fool you.
I'm sorry. I really am.

10:52.360 --> 10:54.028
If you feel that bad, break it off.

10:54.111 --> 10:55.154
How can I do that?

10:55.237 --> 10:58.532
Su-jin, can't you please
try to understand just this once?

11:02.328 --> 11:03.579
Understand?

11:05.414 --> 11:07.083
As of now, we're no longer friends.

11:08.084 --> 11:08.918
Su-jin!

11:09.001 --> 11:11.003
Are you the girl who's dating Lee Soo-ho?

11:11.087 --> 11:12.838
Drag her to the rooftop.

11:12.922 --> 11:14.507
No!

11:14.590 --> 11:17.009
No!

11:17.093 --> 11:19.095
Su-jin!

11:19.178 --> 11:21.013
- Su-jin…
- Don't cry.

11:21.097 --> 11:24.642
- Su-jin, are you okay?
- You swore to me you had no boyfriend.

11:24.725 --> 11:25.768
What a two-faced girl!

11:25.851 --> 11:26.936
- Two-faced.
- Seriously.

11:27.019 --> 11:28.938
- How could she?
- That was deceitful.

11:29.021 --> 11:30.106
That's enough girls.

11:30.189 --> 11:32.775
It's my fault for not telling Soo-ho
how I feel sooner.

11:32.858 --> 11:35.277
- Come on.
- It's not your fault.

11:37.279 --> 11:38.823
What are you saying?

11:40.282 --> 11:41.283
Kang Su-jin,

11:41.367 --> 11:42.701
do you have feelings for me?

11:43.202 --> 11:46.038
- Since when? Why didn't you tell me?
- How could I?

11:46.122 --> 11:47.081
How could I tell you

11:47.164 --> 11:49.583
that I developed feelings
after ten years of friendship?

11:51.502 --> 11:53.462
If that's the case,
I wouldn't have dated Ju-kyung.

11:53.546 --> 11:55.714
What's the point?
You're already her boyfriend.

11:57.550 --> 11:58.426
I'll make things right.

11:58.509 --> 11:59.385
Lim Ju-kyung,

12:00.302 --> 12:01.887
let's end things between us.

12:07.518 --> 12:08.602
No!

12:09.895 --> 12:11.063
LITERATURE FINAL EXAM RANGE

12:11.147 --> 12:12.565
- What the heck?
- That scared me!

12:13.232 --> 12:14.066
All right.

12:14.150 --> 12:16.610
Since Ju-kyung feels
that strongly about it,

12:16.694 --> 12:19.155
I won't be adding
more chapters to the final exam.

12:31.834 --> 12:32.835
Ju-kyung!

12:34.503 --> 12:36.505
- What?
- Why are you leaving by yourself?

12:36.589 --> 12:38.507
- What?
- We have a study group today.

12:42.011 --> 12:43.596
So we can walk together.

12:45.848 --> 12:46.974
Soo-ho!

12:48.559 --> 12:49.602
Heading to the study group?

12:51.479 --> 12:52.313
Guys,

12:52.980 --> 12:54.607
I'm going to skip today.

12:54.690 --> 12:56.609
Why? Did something come up?

12:57.985 --> 13:00.362
I'm not feeling very well today.

13:01.280 --> 13:02.281
I'll get going then.

13:04.033 --> 13:04.950
Bye.

13:07.369 --> 13:08.704
I wonder how bad it is.

13:25.721 --> 13:26.555
LOVE COUNSELING

13:26.639 --> 13:27.473
What do I do?

13:27.556 --> 13:29.225
I'm dating this guy in secret,

13:29.308 --> 13:31.101
and my best friend likes him too.

13:31.185 --> 13:32.019
If you were me,

13:32.102 --> 13:34.063
would you tell her what's going on?

13:34.146 --> 13:35.814
Never. Keep the secret to the grave.

13:35.898 --> 13:37.316
Coming from someone who's lost both.

13:37.399 --> 13:38.859
If she's a true friend, yes. She'd get it.

13:38.943 --> 13:40.027
You could always get a new guy.

13:40.110 --> 13:42.404
But how could you break things
for a friend when you like him?

13:44.532 --> 13:45.991
What do I do?

13:51.497 --> 13:52.748
Meet me at Prince Comics?

13:52.831 --> 13:54.708
Han Go-un's not here, so don't worry.

14:01.924 --> 14:04.635
PRINCE COMICS

14:05.219 --> 14:06.470
Did you take some medicine?

14:06.554 --> 14:09.014
I wasn't sure why you were sick
so I bought everything.

14:09.682 --> 14:11.850
It's okay, I don't need any medicine.

14:11.934 --> 14:13.769
All I need is some rest.

14:13.852 --> 14:16.313
You should still take some.
Have some porridge first.

14:17.231 --> 14:18.148
Here.

14:25.030 --> 14:25.865
What's wrong?

14:27.032 --> 14:28.117
Does it hurt that much?

14:28.868 --> 14:29.827
No.

14:31.078 --> 14:32.246
I'm just grateful.

14:34.790 --> 14:37.543
You even worked out
after being worn out from your shift.

14:37.626 --> 14:38.752
That must have done it.

14:40.546 --> 14:42.381
I shouldn't have asked you to come out.

14:42.464 --> 14:44.300
What's going on with you?

14:46.093 --> 14:47.845
Why are you being so sweet?

14:50.848 --> 14:52.850
You have a handsome face and great grades,

14:52.933 --> 14:54.810
so your only flaw was your awful temper.

14:54.894 --> 14:56.604
But now you're acting sweet too!

14:56.687 --> 14:58.647
How can people see you as a friend
when you're so perfect?

14:58.731 --> 15:00.733
How could anyone
not fall in love with you?

15:02.443 --> 15:03.402
Who fell for whom?

15:15.372 --> 15:16.624
What is it?

15:16.707 --> 15:18.250
My dad was right.

15:19.752 --> 15:22.713
Handsome guys bring
a handsome amount of heartache.

15:27.259 --> 15:28.260
It's hot.

15:29.845 --> 15:31.055
Blow on it first.

15:37.353 --> 15:39.104
Have some meat too.

15:51.033 --> 15:52.785
Are you going to stay upset with me?

15:53.911 --> 15:55.913
You're not talking to me anymore?

15:55.996 --> 15:56.872
Jun-woo.

15:57.539 --> 15:58.958
Han Jun-woo.

15:59.041 --> 16:00.084
Babe!

16:08.425 --> 16:09.259
Okay.

16:10.511 --> 16:11.553
That was…

16:12.096 --> 16:12.930
I…

16:13.472 --> 16:15.724
lost it for a moment
and had a misunderstanding.

16:16.392 --> 16:19.687
But who wouldn't go crazy seeing her man
with another woman like that?

16:19.770 --> 16:20.854
Both of them

16:21.522 --> 16:22.940
teach Ju-kyung as well.

16:23.816 --> 16:26.443
Didn't you consider
I'd be put in an awkward position?

16:28.070 --> 16:29.154
Well…

16:30.614 --> 16:31.782
I'm sorry.

16:31.865 --> 16:33.784
If you had told me before,
I wouldn't have…

16:33.867 --> 16:36.286
You don't tell me anything,
so why would I?

16:36.370 --> 16:37.997
You've been drinking more lately.

16:38.998 --> 16:42.209
Something clearly happened at work,
but you don't tell me about it.

16:42.292 --> 16:44.128
What's the point of moaning and whining?

16:44.628 --> 16:46.130
Would you rather I cried?

16:50.134 --> 16:52.428
You and I aren't strangers.
We're together now.

16:53.554 --> 16:55.305
If something comes up in the future,

16:55.389 --> 16:56.223
let's…

16:56.890 --> 16:57.933
share the burden.

17:05.566 --> 17:06.859
What do I do?

17:08.235 --> 17:09.570
I want to kiss you right now.

17:10.779 --> 17:11.739
What?

17:11.822 --> 17:13.699
You're out of your mind!

17:13.782 --> 17:16.243
I'll share everything with you.

17:16.326 --> 17:18.454
Even what I eat for lunch every day.

17:24.126 --> 17:26.170
MAKEUP ARTIST LICENSE
WRITTEN EXAM QUESTIONS

17:26.879 --> 17:27.921
WARM VS. COOL UNDERTONE

17:28.005 --> 17:29.381
LOVE VS. FRIENDSHIP

17:36.180 --> 17:37.431
Hey, Lim Ju-bal.

17:37.514 --> 17:38.640
I told you to knock!

17:38.724 --> 17:41.560
- Do you have any comic books to return?
- No.

17:42.352 --> 17:44.063
- Then how about to borrow?
- None.

17:44.146 --> 17:45.898
Why not?

17:45.981 --> 17:47.816
You used to borrow ten books daily!

17:47.900 --> 17:48.734
Watch it.

17:49.234 --> 17:52.112
Hey, why are you so eager
to go to the comics shop?

17:53.155 --> 17:54.490
Eager?

17:54.573 --> 17:56.450
Eager? Jeez.

17:56.533 --> 17:58.869
I don't want to go
anywhere near Prince Comics.

18:00.579 --> 18:01.497
Goodness.

18:03.123 --> 18:06.126
Why is he also acting out
when I have enough to worry about?

18:09.588 --> 18:11.131
MY FRIEND SU-JIN

18:18.931 --> 18:20.140
Hey, Su-jin.

18:30.526 --> 18:33.112
- What?
- What? I'm here to borrow some comics.

18:40.869 --> 18:42.621
EXPLICIT CONTENT
ONE NIGHT STAND WITH THE WILD WOLF

18:42.704 --> 18:43.872
I'm not sure why…

18:44.581 --> 18:47.668
I understand your needs,
but you need to wait another three years.

18:48.502 --> 18:49.586
Darn it.

18:49.670 --> 18:51.588
I grabbed that by accident.

18:53.257 --> 18:55.008
I'm not that kind of person.

18:55.092 --> 18:57.636
I might have these steaming hot looks,

18:57.719 --> 18:59.179
but my heart is innocent.

19:00.013 --> 19:01.682
You're in my way. Move over.

19:03.016 --> 19:04.476
Not that I'm curious,

19:04.560 --> 19:06.770
but I'll ask since I have
some time on my hands.

19:07.396 --> 19:08.564
What's the reason?

19:09.356 --> 19:10.858
Here we go again.

19:10.941 --> 19:13.318
I've got the looks, the body,

19:13.402 --> 19:14.403
and the brains.

19:14.486 --> 19:16.905
Why would you reject
such a perfect guy like me?

19:16.989 --> 19:18.198
I don't like you.

19:18.866 --> 19:21.160
But I don't see why you would. So why?

19:21.243 --> 19:22.661
Give me ten reasons.

19:22.744 --> 19:23.829
I'll back off then.

19:23.912 --> 19:25.497
Seriously, you're so annoying.

19:26.665 --> 19:28.250
One. You're not my type.

19:28.333 --> 19:30.043
Two. You're too skinny.

19:30.127 --> 19:31.670
Three. You're too into yourself.

19:31.753 --> 19:32.921
Four. I hate your voice.

19:33.005 --> 19:34.173
Five. A bad personality.

19:34.256 --> 19:36.091
- Six. You're not funny. Seven--
- Stop it.

19:36.175 --> 19:38.677
My list can go on to 100, so go home.

19:39.928 --> 19:41.722
Go-un, I'm here.

19:41.805 --> 19:43.307
What are you doing here, Seo-jun?

19:43.390 --> 19:44.683
I was in the neighborhood…

19:45.767 --> 19:47.644
and I stopped by in case you were hungry.

19:49.563 --> 19:50.439
You're the best.

19:50.522 --> 19:52.149
Han Seo-jun is her boyfriend?

19:52.232 --> 19:53.400
Do you want some?

19:57.362 --> 19:58.197
Okay.

19:58.864 --> 20:00.032
Now I get it.

20:00.782 --> 20:02.117
The reason she rejected me.

20:08.498 --> 20:09.541
Who's that nutcase?

20:10.209 --> 20:11.293
Just some nutcase.

20:12.252 --> 20:14.129
If he gives you trouble, tell me. Got it?

20:14.213 --> 20:15.589
I told you before.

20:15.672 --> 20:18.008
Why bother with a part-time job?
I told you not to.

20:18.091 --> 20:18.926
You're too young.

20:19.009 --> 20:21.220
You act like you know better
when you're only a year older.

20:22.012 --> 20:23.555
Let's see what you brought.

20:23.639 --> 20:25.140
I was super hungry.

20:26.183 --> 20:27.809
- Great job.
- I know what you like.

20:35.734 --> 20:36.652
What?

20:36.735 --> 20:38.153
She's really pretty.

20:43.992 --> 20:46.245
She sure is really pretty.

20:48.121 --> 20:49.081
Su-jin!

20:50.415 --> 20:51.667
Ju-kyung.

20:54.461 --> 20:55.545
Did I keep you waiting?

20:55.629 --> 20:57.256
No, not at all. Let's go.

21:01.510 --> 21:02.678
Let's take a look around,

21:03.303 --> 21:04.263
Are you buying a hat?

21:04.846 --> 21:06.932
Yes. Which one looks good?

21:09.559 --> 21:11.436
How about this? It will look good on you.

21:12.187 --> 21:15.357
It's not for me.
It's a present for Soo-ho.

21:17.276 --> 21:19.403
- Soo-ho?
- Yes.

21:19.486 --> 21:22.781
My family and his family
shared a meal together recently,

21:22.864 --> 21:24.449
and Soo-ho saved me that day.

21:26.910 --> 21:27.953
How did he save you?

21:28.954 --> 21:31.290
My dad was suffocating me,
and suddenly he said,

21:31.373 --> 21:33.500
"We have a study session. Let's go."

21:33.583 --> 21:35.419
He took off, taking me with him.

21:36.169 --> 21:37.379
He was so awesome.

21:39.506 --> 21:40.465
I see.

21:40.549 --> 21:42.634
How about this? Will it look good on him?

21:42.718 --> 21:44.011
You have a younger brother,

21:44.094 --> 21:45.971
so you must know what guys are into.

21:48.640 --> 21:51.768
- I think it looks nice.
- You do? Then I'll get this one.

21:52.436 --> 21:53.603
I hope he likes it.

21:54.813 --> 21:55.647
Sure.

21:56.398 --> 21:57.441
By the way, Ju-kyung,

21:58.442 --> 22:00.694
should I tell him how I feel
when I give him this?

22:02.904 --> 22:03.739
What?

22:04.323 --> 22:05.824
Would it catch him off guard?

22:05.907 --> 22:08.076
We've been friends
for more than ten years,

22:08.160 --> 22:09.661
so he wouldn't cut me off, right?

22:14.291 --> 22:16.084
I'm not really sure.

22:16.168 --> 22:18.462
Is it right to tell him how I feel?

22:18.545 --> 22:20.839
Either way, you'll support me, right?

22:27.179 --> 22:28.680
BOYFRIEND

22:31.141 --> 22:32.350
Who is it? Take it.

22:35.103 --> 22:36.271
It's all right.

22:37.355 --> 22:39.441
The person you are trying to reach is…

22:39.524 --> 22:41.068
GIRLFRIEND

22:42.486 --> 22:44.279
I'm helping my dad with chores,

22:44.362 --> 22:45.822
so I can't pick up.

22:46.698 --> 22:48.366
She can't even answer the phone?

22:51.203 --> 22:52.496
My dad was right.

22:53.330 --> 22:56.124
Handsome guys bring
a handsome amount of heartache.

23:04.800 --> 23:07.219
My girlfriend's dad caught us kissing.

23:07.302 --> 23:09.346
- I'd kill the guy if I'd been there.
- You'll see when you have a daughter.

23:09.429 --> 23:11.598
You can't even hold hands
in front of your girlfriend's dad.

23:20.857 --> 23:22.025
Lee Soo-ho!

23:22.109 --> 23:23.693
You dirty animal!

23:23.777 --> 23:26.947
I'm going to crush anyone
who touches my daughter!

23:31.284 --> 23:32.119
I'm screwed.

23:33.245 --> 23:34.371
Are you heading to work?

23:35.038 --> 23:37.374
Yes, it's nearby.

23:37.457 --> 23:38.667
Good luck with your shift.

23:40.252 --> 23:42.295
It looked cute,
so I bought it with the hat.

23:43.839 --> 23:44.756
Do you like it?

23:44.840 --> 23:46.550
It's cute.

23:47.259 --> 23:48.176
Wait for it.

23:48.260 --> 23:49.928
I got a matching one.

23:52.139 --> 23:53.515
It's really pretty.

23:54.516 --> 23:55.392
Thank you.

23:55.475 --> 23:56.977
No, thank you.

23:57.060 --> 23:59.980
Thanks for hanging out with me
before work.

24:00.063 --> 24:02.524
- You'll be late, so get going.
- Okay.

24:03.859 --> 24:06.027
- See you tomorrow.
- Okay. Take care.

24:28.008 --> 24:29.050
What?

24:29.718 --> 24:30.886
What are you doing here?

24:32.888 --> 24:35.473
The boss asked me to fill in for someone.

24:35.557 --> 24:37.809
I didn't want to, but I had no choice.

24:38.894 --> 24:39.728
I see.

24:40.478 --> 24:42.397
I'll get changed and join you.

24:55.076 --> 24:55.911
Hey!

24:56.494 --> 24:58.455
Why would you tie your hair
all of a sudden?

24:58.538 --> 25:01.249
Who ties their hair like that
in front of a friend?

25:01.333 --> 25:02.792
I need to if I want to work.

25:03.376 --> 25:04.294
What's wrong?

25:06.588 --> 25:07.422
Go ahead.

25:17.307 --> 25:18.141
Here you go.

25:18.934 --> 25:20.602
Welcome!

25:20.685 --> 25:23.230
- One Americano.
- One Americano.

25:23.313 --> 25:25.148
- One latte, please.
- One latte.

25:25.857 --> 25:27.192
- Here you go.
- Thank you.

25:35.200 --> 25:36.952
- I'll do it.
- It's okay. I'll do it.

25:58.098 --> 25:59.307
Take a break.

26:01.351 --> 26:03.561
This glass is spotless.

26:03.645 --> 26:05.647
Why would you keep wiping it?

26:06.690 --> 26:07.732
Is it already?

26:08.733 --> 26:10.235
What are you thinking about?

26:11.486 --> 26:12.946
I'm not thinking about anything.

26:14.531 --> 26:15.699
Did you fight with Soo-ho?

26:17.075 --> 26:18.451
Why would we?

26:19.286 --> 26:21.579
You fought, right? You definitely did.

26:22.998 --> 26:23.915
No, we didn't.

26:23.999 --> 26:26.084
You've already fought
and it's been how long?

26:26.167 --> 26:28.086
You two might as well just break up!

26:32.716 --> 26:33.550
Hey,

26:34.259 --> 26:35.093
are you crying?

26:38.388 --> 26:39.764
Did you really break up?

26:42.934 --> 26:43.935
I said we didn't.

26:45.478 --> 26:46.813
Get back to work.

26:50.150 --> 26:51.443
What was that?

27:00.952 --> 27:01.870
Mr. Lim.

27:04.039 --> 27:05.206
How are you?

27:05.999 --> 27:06.833
Hello, Soo-ho.

27:07.500 --> 27:09.002
Are you here to see Ju-kyung?

27:09.085 --> 27:11.546
It's a shame.
Ju-kyung's not home right now.

27:11.629 --> 27:12.630
She's not?

27:14.883 --> 27:16.301
I thought she was at home.

27:17.093 --> 27:18.053
Goodbye, then.

27:20.138 --> 27:21.056
Wait a second.

27:22.974 --> 27:24.768
I came to give you this.

27:39.991 --> 27:42.702
SAEBOM STATION, SAEBOM HIGH SCHOOL

27:50.126 --> 27:51.002
What?

27:51.086 --> 27:52.837
Your place isn't in this part of town.

27:53.630 --> 27:55.882
I thought I'd go home
with Go-un after her shift.

28:02.138 --> 28:03.640
You've been sighing all day.

28:06.351 --> 28:07.644
Hey,

28:07.727 --> 28:11.106
have you ever liked the same girl
as your best friend?

28:12.065 --> 28:12.899
What?

28:14.234 --> 28:16.403
Did Soo-ho say that? What did he say?

28:16.486 --> 28:17.904
How much did he tell you?

28:17.987 --> 28:20.448
Why are you getting upset
as if this is about you?

28:20.949 --> 28:22.826
- Do you like someone?
- No!

28:23.660 --> 28:24.619
It's not like that.

28:25.662 --> 28:29.165
Two girls liked me at once.
That's what I was getting at.

28:29.249 --> 28:31.042
I'm just very popular like that.

28:32.168 --> 28:33.545
Show off much?

28:34.129 --> 28:34.963
Anyway.

28:35.672 --> 28:37.006
Why do you ask?

28:38.133 --> 28:39.259
Well…

28:40.969 --> 28:43.179
This is about a friend of a friend.

28:44.514 --> 28:46.808
So my friend's friend got a boyfriend,

28:46.891 --> 28:48.601
but a friend of my friend's friend

28:48.685 --> 28:50.979
suddenly told her
that she likes her boyfriend.

28:51.646 --> 28:52.981
But that friend

28:53.064 --> 28:55.900
doesn't know that my friend's friend
is dating that guy,

28:56.568 --> 28:58.737
so my friend's friend
is wondering what to do.

28:58.820 --> 29:02.991
She's debating whether or not
to tell her friend she's dating the guy.

29:03.074 --> 29:03.908
Okay.

29:04.701 --> 29:05.827
What?

29:07.537 --> 29:08.371
Gosh.

29:08.955 --> 29:10.790
I'll put it this way.

29:11.499 --> 29:13.334
I'm dating Lee Soo-ho.

29:13.418 --> 29:14.836
You and I are friends, right?

29:14.919 --> 29:17.422
But it turns out
that you also like Soo-ho…

29:19.466 --> 29:20.592
Are you kidding me?

29:21.176 --> 29:23.428
Was the analogy a bit off?

29:24.095 --> 29:25.638
Well, anyway…

29:25.722 --> 29:28.016
So what you're saying is
you and Soo-ho are dating,

29:28.099 --> 29:30.059
but Su-jin also likes Soo-ho.

29:30.643 --> 29:33.229
But she doesn't know
that you two are dating.

29:33.313 --> 29:34.647
That's it, right?

29:34.731 --> 29:36.107
Yes. No--

29:37.150 --> 29:37.984
I guess.

29:38.693 --> 29:41.613
Hypothetically, you could say that.
Just as an example.

29:41.696 --> 29:45.742
So you're worried that telling Su-jin
might ruin your friendship.

29:45.825 --> 29:49.162
You're saying you have to choose
between love and friendship, right?

29:49.829 --> 29:50.663
Well,

29:51.164 --> 29:54.000
I'm not sure if it is
a matter of choice or not.

29:54.667 --> 29:57.629
Anyway, my friend's friend
is worried about it.

29:58.296 --> 30:00.465
If you're a girl,
you should choose friendship.

30:01.174 --> 30:02.675
Love doesn't last forever.

30:02.759 --> 30:06.721
Tell her to break things off with her guy
and work on her friendship more.

30:06.805 --> 30:08.973
How can you break up
with someone you like?

30:09.057 --> 30:10.558
I don't know who that guy is,

30:10.642 --> 30:13.228
but he shouldn't have gotten
himself in such a situation.

30:14.103 --> 30:17.065
You don't want to date a guy
with complicated relationships.

30:17.941 --> 30:20.860
- Just break up.
- His relationships aren't complicated.

30:22.529 --> 30:24.531
According to my friend's friend,

30:25.031 --> 30:26.407
that is.

30:28.701 --> 30:29.786
Don't worry.

30:30.829 --> 30:32.956
Lee Soo-ho isn't the type
to make you worry.

30:34.374 --> 30:36.709
I told you, it's not about me.

30:37.794 --> 30:38.920
Whatever.

30:47.220 --> 30:50.181
When are you coming?
Grab some instant noodles on the way home.

30:53.601 --> 30:55.895
Hey, your shoelace is undone.

30:56.688 --> 30:57.939
Leave it, just keep moving.

30:58.022 --> 31:00.525
You could trip and faceplant.

31:00.608 --> 31:01.609
Come on, tie it.

31:02.610 --> 31:03.444
Why?

31:03.528 --> 31:05.697
Worried that my handsome face
might get crushed?

31:06.531 --> 31:08.950
Everything I do is for style, okay?

31:09.033 --> 31:10.159
Typical.

31:10.243 --> 31:12.620
You think just like Ju-young.

31:14.247 --> 31:15.498
Okay, lift your foot up.

31:16.165 --> 31:19.168
Gosh, you're so high-maintenance.

31:23.339 --> 31:24.549
There you go.

31:29.053 --> 31:30.054
Hey, Ju-kyung!

31:31.431 --> 31:32.599
It's undone again.

31:33.099 --> 31:34.142
Tie it right.

31:34.684 --> 31:35.935
You do it yourself.

31:37.145 --> 31:39.063
What if I faceplant?

31:39.564 --> 31:42.150
- Hey!
- Hey, be careful!

31:42.233 --> 31:43.776
Well, I'm not good at tying shoes.

31:43.860 --> 31:45.695
I said, do it yourself.

31:45.778 --> 31:46.946
How do I tie it?

31:47.030 --> 31:49.240
- You don't know how to tie your shoes?
- No.

31:49.324 --> 31:52.452
PRINCE COMICS

31:52.535 --> 31:53.912
Hey, Go-un's not here.

31:53.995 --> 31:54.996
Really?

31:55.079 --> 31:56.497
Did she already head back?

31:56.581 --> 31:59.042
Jeez. You should have called her first.

31:59.125 --> 32:01.002
I'm heading home. Get home safe.

32:01.586 --> 32:03.087
- Bye.
- Are you just getting back?

32:04.797 --> 32:05.924
Seo-jun!

32:07.675 --> 32:08.509
Hello.

32:09.135 --> 32:10.929
Long time no see!

32:11.012 --> 32:13.348
I see you've gotten close with Ju-kyung.

32:13.932 --> 32:15.850
I've been taking care of her at school.

32:16.434 --> 32:18.227
When did you ever take care of me?

32:18.853 --> 32:19.979
Did you have dinner yet?

32:20.063 --> 32:21.648
We're making dumplings at home.

32:21.731 --> 32:24.275
Why don't you join us?
And take some home for your mom.

32:24.359 --> 32:25.902
Don't ask him to stay for dinner.

32:25.985 --> 32:27.362
You go home. Let's go, Mom.

32:27.445 --> 32:28.363
Why?

32:29.572 --> 32:32.158
- Ma'am, let's go.
- Okay, let's go.

32:33.159 --> 32:34.827
- Do you like dumplings?
- I love them.

32:34.911 --> 32:36.245
That's great!

32:36.329 --> 32:38.873
- Why are we having dumplings?
- Just shut up and come.

32:38.957 --> 32:41.042
Come in, our place is a little shabby.

32:43.336 --> 32:44.170
Right.

32:44.253 --> 32:47.215
I forgot to tell you
that dear Soo-ho is here too.

32:51.886 --> 32:54.597
Ju-kyung's friends are all at our place!

32:55.181 --> 32:56.265
"Dear Soo-ho"?

32:58.059 --> 32:59.102
What…

32:59.185 --> 33:00.103
are you doing here?

33:00.770 --> 33:03.272
I just ran into Soo-ho
in front of our place.

33:03.356 --> 33:05.858
So I invited him in to stay for dinner.

33:06.734 --> 33:09.445
- Why are you two coming in together?
- I had my part-time--

33:09.946 --> 33:11.823
You said that was a secret
from your family.

33:13.825 --> 33:16.411
- We were hanging out.
- You said you were busy with chores.

33:16.995 --> 33:19.038
- You were hanging out?
- Well…

33:19.122 --> 33:20.289
Controlling much?

33:21.374 --> 33:22.500
Even if you're dating--

33:23.001 --> 33:24.877
Hey, my mom doesn't know we date.

33:24.961 --> 33:26.254
That's a secret too?

33:28.339 --> 33:31.759
We have so many people,
we'll make the dumplings in no time!

33:31.843 --> 33:34.345
What? You haven't even made them yet?

33:34.429 --> 33:37.348
- Why would you have them make dumplings?
- Here we go.

33:37.432 --> 33:40.226
Dumplings taste best
when freshly made and steamed.

33:40.309 --> 33:42.353
What's wrong with you? Aren't I right?

33:42.937 --> 33:44.105
Of course.

33:47.942 --> 33:50.028
Han Go-un's boyfriend, Han Seo-jun.

33:50.528 --> 33:52.363
So I meet my rival here.

33:56.826 --> 33:57.952
Soo-ho.

33:58.745 --> 34:01.122
Sprinkle more flour.
The dough will stick otherwise.

34:01.205 --> 34:02.373
Thank you.

34:04.417 --> 34:07.545
- Seo-jun makes such pretty dumplings.
- I've tried it at home.

34:08.129 --> 34:10.048
Mom told me I have to
make pretty dumplings

34:10.548 --> 34:11.758
to have a pretty daughter.

34:12.550 --> 34:14.093
So I tried hard to master it.

34:14.177 --> 34:17.930
Mi-hyang must make pretty dumplings
since she has a very handsome son.

34:18.014 --> 34:19.015
Not at all.

34:19.098 --> 34:20.558
You must be popular at school.

34:20.641 --> 34:21.642
Maybe a little.

34:22.602 --> 34:23.436
Popular?

34:24.395 --> 34:26.689
I doubt he can compete with Soo-ho.

34:26.773 --> 34:30.193
Gosh, your entire body is glowing!

34:30.818 --> 34:32.653
Look at his arms bulging!

34:35.990 --> 34:37.241
Anyway, Seo-jun,

34:37.325 --> 34:40.078
why were you hanging out with my sister
when you have a girlfriend?

34:40.161 --> 34:41.079
Me?

34:41.996 --> 34:43.206
I don't have a girlfriend.

34:43.289 --> 34:45.374
What a bastard.

34:45.458 --> 34:46.501
Here.

34:47.251 --> 34:49.504
Have some water to refresh yourselves.

34:50.254 --> 34:52.673
My goodness!

34:52.757 --> 34:55.927
I almost spilled on the floor.

34:56.010 --> 34:57.762
What has gotten into him?

34:57.845 --> 34:59.180
You should have been careful.

34:59.263 --> 35:00.139
Thank you.

35:00.223 --> 35:01.933
Anyway, Ju-kyung is so lucky.

35:02.016 --> 35:04.102
She has two handsome friends like you.

35:04.602 --> 35:06.771
Keep hanging out with them
so you can pick one

35:06.854 --> 35:08.606
and date him when you go to college.

35:08.689 --> 35:10.358
What's there to pick?

35:13.694 --> 35:16.364
Well, I personally give my vote to Soo-ho.

35:19.534 --> 35:22.286
Come on. Why are you voting?

35:22.370 --> 35:24.288
My vote goes to Soo-ho as well.

35:25.206 --> 35:27.291
I love you, Soo-ho.

35:28.334 --> 35:29.752
Actually,

35:29.836 --> 35:31.170
I had a mind to make Seo-jun

35:31.254 --> 35:34.465
Ju-kyung's boyfriend later.

35:34.549 --> 35:37.135
Let me know if you need
a ticket to my dad's fan meeting.

35:37.218 --> 35:40.096
My goodness. Do you mean it?

35:40.847 --> 35:42.640
You don't even talk to your dad.

35:43.724 --> 35:44.892
What are you looking at?

35:44.976 --> 35:47.728
I'm not sure who to pick out of the two.

35:47.812 --> 35:49.564
Why are you contemplating who to pick?

35:49.647 --> 35:51.732
Let's just hurry
and make dumplings in silence.

35:51.816 --> 35:53.067
But it's fun.

35:54.527 --> 35:58.156
My vote will go to
whoever makes better dumplings.

37:07.308 --> 37:08.309
- Stop.
- Stop.

37:08.392 --> 37:09.560
- Stop.
- Stop…

38:38.441 --> 38:41.986
These dumplings are definitely something.
They're almost like…

38:42.069 --> 38:45.156
- Crouching tiger, hidden dragon.
- No. Crouching crane, hidden dragon.

38:45.239 --> 38:46.073
But still,

38:46.157 --> 38:47.658
I like the one on the right more.

38:51.203 --> 38:53.080
By the way, what did you make this with?

38:57.501 --> 38:58.336
Dad.

39:04.425 --> 39:06.344
Seo-jun wins!

39:10.931 --> 39:12.725
No, honey. I broke it, so…

39:28.532 --> 39:30.534
Who cares about dumplings?

39:31.118 --> 39:32.703
I'm still so worried.

39:37.666 --> 39:38.709
Can I come in?

39:42.338 --> 39:44.673
Sure. Just a second!

39:49.595 --> 39:50.805
Come in!

39:52.973 --> 39:53.808
Well…

39:54.600 --> 39:56.435
I was about to head out.

39:56.519 --> 39:57.353
What is it?

40:01.232 --> 40:03.359
So this is what your room is like.

40:04.026 --> 40:05.778
Yes. Just as unimpressive as me.

40:05.861 --> 40:07.571
You've seen it now, right? Let's go.

40:09.615 --> 40:10.616
If we go back out,

40:11.409 --> 40:12.701
I can't talk to you.

40:15.079 --> 40:15.913
So…

40:16.497 --> 40:17.998
what did you do with Han Seo-jun?

40:18.624 --> 40:20.292
We didn't hang out. We were working.

40:22.086 --> 40:24.338
I told you he helped me
get the part-time job.

40:24.422 --> 40:26.507
He came to fill in for someone today.

40:26.590 --> 40:29.427
But my parents don't know about my job,
so he said that.

40:29.510 --> 40:31.095
Then you should have told me
you were working.

40:31.178 --> 40:33.347
Why did you lie to me
saying you had chores?

40:38.602 --> 40:40.187
Don't do that from now on.

40:42.273 --> 40:43.107
Okay.

40:43.649 --> 40:44.483
Sorry.

40:47.570 --> 40:52.199
Don't people usually show their boyfriends
old photo albums when they come over?

40:52.908 --> 40:54.785
I'm never going to show you.

40:54.869 --> 40:56.370
Why share my dark past?

40:56.454 --> 40:57.455
And yet,

40:57.538 --> 40:59.165
here it is on display.

41:03.169 --> 41:04.253
This isn't me.

41:05.254 --> 41:08.257
"Saessak Kindergarten, Lim Ju-kyung."
It's written right here.

41:09.049 --> 41:11.010
Jeez. Why did I have to put this here?

41:15.848 --> 41:16.724
What?

41:18.517 --> 41:19.643
Why?

41:19.727 --> 41:21.395
Are you shocked I looked so ugly?

41:22.563 --> 41:23.564
You…

41:25.316 --> 41:26.150
Yes?

41:29.361 --> 41:31.489
Nothing. Can I keep this?

41:32.239 --> 41:34.492
Why would you bother taking that?

41:34.575 --> 41:36.577
- Hey, give it back.
- Just this one.

41:36.660 --> 41:38.746
- Why would you take it?
- I'll just take one.

41:38.829 --> 41:40.247
- Why?
- Just one photo!

41:48.088 --> 41:49.590
Ju-kyung, is Soo-ho…

41:50.925 --> 41:52.259
He is here.

42:00.142 --> 42:01.352
We're right downstairs.

42:02.102 --> 42:03.354
I just fell down.

42:03.437 --> 42:04.688
I know you fell down.

42:05.189 --> 42:06.023
Soo-ho.

42:07.066 --> 42:08.192
Remember what I said?

42:08.275 --> 42:09.652
- W.
- Wholesome.

42:09.735 --> 42:11.028
- I.
- Innocent.

42:11.111 --> 42:12.571
Keep that in mind.

42:17.117 --> 42:18.202
Dad, come on.

42:18.285 --> 42:20.287
She asked me to bring the table out.

42:24.166 --> 42:25.459
Where is the table?

42:27.503 --> 42:28.629
It's right here.

42:29.421 --> 42:30.881
It's like this is your place.

42:31.799 --> 42:34.260
Hey, how are you two fighting
when you've barely dated?

42:34.343 --> 42:36.762
What are you talking about?
We didn't fight.

42:36.845 --> 42:38.055
If you didn't fight,

42:38.138 --> 42:41.183
then why would she be distracted
and sighing all day?

42:41.267 --> 42:43.561
She was weighing love against friendship.

42:44.687 --> 42:47.731
Whatever happens between us,
don't you cross the line.

42:49.108 --> 42:51.735
- It's none of your business.
- So help me not to butt in.

42:52.236 --> 42:55.155
Don't make her worried
that she comes to me for dating advice.

42:55.656 --> 42:57.074
It makes me want to get between you two.

42:58.617 --> 43:00.077
What the hell are you talking about?

43:01.161 --> 43:02.788
Did I say something wrong?

43:08.460 --> 43:10.379
- Mom, I'll put these in the kitchen.
- Okay.

43:21.932 --> 43:23.017
You come here.

43:23.100 --> 43:25.728
Let go. Your head, everything…

43:40.200 --> 43:41.118
Here.

43:44.121 --> 43:46.498
Keep these in the freezer
and steam them, okay?

43:47.374 --> 43:48.375
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

43:48.459 --> 43:49.543
Don't you two fight.

43:50.294 --> 43:52.713
I'm not sure what happened
between you two,

43:53.380 --> 43:54.757
but talk things out.

43:54.840 --> 43:57.092
It'll get worse if you bottle things up.

43:57.760 --> 44:00.429
I'm sure they'll deal with it.
Let's get back in, okay?

44:00.512 --> 44:02.014
Come on.

44:12.399 --> 44:13.609
I love you.

44:17.071 --> 44:18.280
I love you.

44:25.496 --> 44:28.415
You two are old enough
to know not to get into a brawl.

44:28.499 --> 44:32.044
- I love you.
- It's only natural for boys at that age.

44:32.795 --> 44:34.129
Dumplings smell good, though.

44:34.213 --> 44:35.673
I love you.

44:49.603 --> 44:50.687
Well,

44:50.771 --> 44:53.232
I went to a Korean restaurant,
and the side dishes were

44:53.315 --> 44:55.275
braised beans, shishito peppers,

44:56.402 --> 44:58.112
and stir-fried squid…

44:58.195 --> 44:59.279
Stop.

45:00.364 --> 45:02.699
You don't have to tell me all that.

45:02.783 --> 45:04.660
I've been sending you updates all day.

45:04.743 --> 45:06.954
I even canceled my staff dinner.
I want a reward.

45:07.996 --> 45:08.831
A reward?

45:08.914 --> 45:09.873
You know what I want.

45:12.000 --> 45:13.168
I'm not sure.

45:13.252 --> 45:15.712
Hey, I'm not going to hang up
until you do it.

45:29.309 --> 45:31.019
You don't have a girlfriend? My foot.

45:41.488 --> 45:42.489
What was that?

45:43.699 --> 45:46.577
- The music video came out well.
- Right? It's totally awesome.

45:46.660 --> 45:48.036
It's catchy.

45:48.120 --> 45:51.457
I was worried it would lack impact
as a debut song because it's so mellow.

45:51.540 --> 45:52.791
But it turned out well.

45:52.875 --> 45:54.710
- Gosh, you scared me.
- What is this song?

45:55.836 --> 45:56.712
Ms. Lim.

45:57.379 --> 45:59.256
Is this Black Soul's debut song?

45:59.798 --> 46:01.258
Isn't this Leo's song?

46:01.341 --> 46:02.176
Sorry?

46:02.676 --> 46:03.927
I don't know what you mean.

46:04.011 --> 46:07.556
They canceled the tribute album project.
How is this song being used like this?

46:07.639 --> 46:10.309
Did you buy it from Leo?
Did you get his permission?

46:16.190 --> 46:19.693
RESERVED FOR LIM JU-KYUNG.
SIT HERE AND YOU'LL GROW BUTT HAIR.

46:42.257 --> 46:43.091
Hey, crybaby.

46:43.592 --> 46:44.426
You're back.

46:44.510 --> 46:45.802
I'm not a crybaby.

46:45.886 --> 46:48.096
Aren't you the kid
who was crying here the last…

46:48.180 --> 46:50.015
Meow.

46:50.891 --> 46:52.434
I cried that one time.

46:55.979 --> 46:58.065
I came here to read that one.

46:58.148 --> 46:59.733
You can have it after I'm done.

46:59.816 --> 47:01.235
It's first come, first served--

47:01.318 --> 47:02.778
I know how things are.

47:03.570 --> 47:05.155
You're petty.

47:18.126 --> 47:19.795
So that guy was a ghost.

47:21.004 --> 47:23.131
Wait, I'm not done yet.

47:23.966 --> 47:25.092
I'm done.

47:25.175 --> 47:26.677
I said I'm not done!

47:31.181 --> 47:32.349
Sir, she just ripped--

47:33.892 --> 47:35.352
Keep this a secret, okay?

47:49.992 --> 47:52.160
I can't believe that girl was Ju-kyung.

48:19.021 --> 48:22.608
You shouldn't make fun of someone's pain.

48:23.191 --> 48:25.068
Sorry. I'm sorry.

48:26.945 --> 48:28.363
You'll be okay now.

48:54.640 --> 48:56.099
The person I like…

48:56.850 --> 48:58.060
is you.

49:35.305 --> 49:37.015
Limju!

49:37.599 --> 49:38.725
What is it now?

49:38.809 --> 49:40.727
- Congratulations!
- Since when did you start going out?

49:40.811 --> 49:42.187
Why didn't you tell me?

49:42.270 --> 49:44.898
So does that make you two
the second couple of our class?

49:45.732 --> 49:46.608
Ju-kyung, is it true?

49:47.192 --> 49:48.026
Su-jin,

49:48.819 --> 49:50.570
I wasn't trying to deceive you…

49:53.198 --> 49:55.575
- Ta-da!
- Ta-da!

49:57.244 --> 49:59.162
I heard you're secretly dating
Han Seo-jun.

49:59.246 --> 50:01.039
You took couple photos too, didn't you?

50:01.123 --> 50:02.165
- Didn't you?
- What?

50:04.376 --> 50:05.419
Me and Han Seo-jun?

50:05.502 --> 50:07.629
What's this?
Cho-rong, what are you doing here?

50:07.713 --> 50:10.674
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

50:19.850 --> 50:21.351
Hey, you schmuck!

50:21.435 --> 50:23.019
I told you she got a boyfriend.

50:24.438 --> 50:25.272
Look at this pose.

50:26.231 --> 50:28.608
Gosh, they look good together, don't they?

50:29.609 --> 50:32.112
Should we take her from him?
But that's not right.

50:32.195 --> 50:33.613
What are you going to do?

50:35.949 --> 50:40.871
- Tell us!
- Tell us!

50:40.954 --> 50:41.913
- Tell us!
- Come on!

50:41.997 --> 50:44.040
Okay, a question from Channel Hyun-kyu!

50:44.124 --> 50:48.712
Your secret date at the K-Mall.
Was that with Mr. Han Seo-jun?

50:48.795 --> 50:51.381
- Did you go on a date?
- When was your first kiss?

50:52.257 --> 50:54.468
Okay, everyone!

50:54.551 --> 50:58.555
We're just good friends,
nothing more and nothing less.

50:58.638 --> 51:01.767
So no more speculative rumors, please.

51:02.517 --> 51:04.227
Are you holding a press conference?

51:05.312 --> 51:06.646
You should say something too.

51:06.730 --> 51:08.148
You're going to let this slide?

51:11.902 --> 51:13.320
- You all!
- Goodness.

51:13.403 --> 51:15.697
You're in big trouble
if you say anything stupid.

51:17.699 --> 51:18.575
Happy?

51:25.749 --> 51:28.585
- Hey, be honest.
- So did you do it or not?

51:28.668 --> 51:30.545
- Man-sik!
- A peck? A kiss?

51:30.629 --> 51:31.880
I'm going to get upset.

51:31.963 --> 51:35.509
- He did it.
- He totally kissed her.

51:36.510 --> 51:37.594
I'm sorry.

51:40.347 --> 51:43.558
Why is the rumor mill
fixated on me and Seo-jun?

51:43.642 --> 51:45.393
Why don't you just date him?

51:45.477 --> 51:47.103
How many times has this happened?

51:47.187 --> 51:50.273
It probably means
that you are meant to be.

51:50.857 --> 51:52.317
We're just friends.

51:52.400 --> 51:54.236
You can be friends, then catch feelings.

51:54.319 --> 51:56.863
Feelings never stay the same forever.

51:57.405 --> 51:59.783
Kangsu, then why don't you date Soo-ho?

51:59.866 --> 52:03.161
You two could suddenly
catch feelings too, right?

52:03.245 --> 52:05.038
Lim Ju-kyung and Han Seo-jun.

52:05.121 --> 52:06.748
Kang Su-jin and Lee Soo-ho.

52:07.374 --> 52:09.626
I can see it already. It feels right.

52:10.460 --> 52:11.294
Should I?

52:12.045 --> 52:13.880
What, Kangsu? Are you serious?

52:13.964 --> 52:15.298
Not at all.

52:16.174 --> 52:17.175
That was very fishy.

52:17.259 --> 52:18.635
Well, this won't do.

52:18.718 --> 52:20.303
I need to dig deep today.

52:20.929 --> 52:23.557
Are you free after school?
Let's hang out, the three of us.

52:24.140 --> 52:25.141
I can't.

52:25.225 --> 52:26.560
I'm meeting with Soo-ho later.

52:27.727 --> 52:29.980
- What?
- Just you and Soo-ho? Why?

52:30.063 --> 52:31.982
Well, I'll tell you later.

52:32.065 --> 52:35.235
Seriously, what is it?
Are you sure nothing is going on?

52:35.318 --> 52:37.112
Please tell me!

52:38.154 --> 52:39.197
Meet me on the rooftop.

52:39.281 --> 52:40.532
- Who is it?
- What?

52:41.449 --> 52:42.284
Well…

52:42.826 --> 52:43.743
It's nothing.

52:55.130 --> 52:56.631
Don't you have something to say?

52:57.632 --> 52:58.466
Say what?

52:59.593 --> 53:00.760
What's with the pictures?

53:01.553 --> 53:02.846
You sound upset.

53:04.222 --> 53:05.056
Yes.

53:05.765 --> 53:06.600
I'm upset.

53:07.183 --> 53:09.269
We met by chance and did a gig together.

53:09.352 --> 53:12.105
He somehow came to the cafe
to fill in for someone,

53:12.188 --> 53:14.524
- and the photo shoot was by chance?
- Yes.

53:14.608 --> 53:15.692
Why didn't you tell me?

53:15.775 --> 53:19.029
I was going to tell you right away,
but you hung up, so…

53:24.910 --> 53:25.827
Then what about you?

53:25.911 --> 53:28.204
Do you report to me
every time you meet someone?

53:28.288 --> 53:29.122
What?

53:29.205 --> 53:31.374
I was getting paid,
so I did as I was told.

53:31.458 --> 53:33.710
I hate your constant involvement
with Seo-jun.

53:33.793 --> 53:35.128
I hate all these rumors too.

53:35.211 --> 53:37.672
- You know we're just friends.
- How do you how he…

53:40.216 --> 53:42.010
Men and women can't just be friends.

53:45.722 --> 53:46.681
Then what about you?

53:48.224 --> 53:49.893
Aren't you and Su-jin old friends?

53:50.560 --> 53:51.895
Why would you bring her up?

54:11.164 --> 54:14.709
Even if I see you walking around
while carrying heavy objects,

54:14.793 --> 54:16.920
I'm never going to help you. You know why?

54:17.504 --> 54:19.673
I've decided not to care
about you anymore.

54:20.256 --> 54:21.341
Whatever.

54:22.926 --> 54:23.760
It won't do.

54:25.261 --> 54:27.222
I still can't bear to see you struggle.

54:27.889 --> 54:29.182
Give it here. I'll carry it.

54:29.265 --> 54:30.684
No thanks. It's heavy.

54:30.767 --> 54:31.893
That's why I'm offering.

54:31.977 --> 54:33.061
It's really heavy.

54:33.144 --> 54:34.771
I'm not going to say it again.

54:34.854 --> 54:35.855
I've got this.

54:50.537 --> 54:52.706
Well, that was…

54:52.789 --> 54:54.874
The sound you just heard is…

54:58.628 --> 54:59.671
Great job.

55:00.255 --> 55:02.716
Holding in a fart isn't healthy.

55:13.268 --> 55:15.145
I've decided to let you go,

55:15.228 --> 55:17.355
so why would you give me
that pretty smile?

55:22.110 --> 55:24.237
Read the dialogue
between the two students.

55:24.320 --> 55:27.490
With the closed interval minus A, A,

55:27.574 --> 55:31.745
if the graph of the continuous function,
y equals f of x,

55:31.828 --> 55:33.747
runs against the y-axis…

55:44.674 --> 55:46.634
- Bye.
- I know.

55:46.718 --> 55:48.178
- Let's go!
- I'm hungry.

55:48.261 --> 55:50.013
- I'm off.
- Okay. See you!

55:59.355 --> 56:00.315
Mr. Han Seo-jun!

56:01.649 --> 56:02.859
Ju-kyung's little brother.

56:04.319 --> 56:05.320
Take a swing.

56:05.403 --> 56:06.529
I'll take it beforehand.

56:07.363 --> 56:08.323
What's this nonsense?

56:09.032 --> 56:12.202
I'm going to take her away from you.

56:14.454 --> 56:15.330
Hello?

56:16.915 --> 56:17.999
Well…

56:18.083 --> 56:19.292
If you're not up for it,

56:19.793 --> 56:21.795
I'll let you punch me after I'm with her.

56:23.713 --> 56:24.964
That nutcase.

56:26.633 --> 56:27.759
Who are you?

56:27.842 --> 56:30.470
Lim Hee-kyung from Move Entertainment.
We've met before.

56:32.639 --> 56:35.475
So you really haven't met
anyone from my company?

56:35.558 --> 56:37.352
I told you I haven't.

56:52.242 --> 56:53.076
Director Oh.

56:54.494 --> 56:55.745
I'm in a bit of a rush.

56:55.829 --> 56:58.248
- I need to ask you something.
- What is it?

56:58.331 --> 57:01.042
I heard Black Soul's debut song
had been changed urgently.

57:01.126 --> 57:04.754
It coincided perfectly with my transfer
and the termination of my project,

57:04.838 --> 57:05.922
interestingly enough.

57:06.005 --> 57:07.423
Why are you telling me that?

57:08.007 --> 57:09.551
I don't have time for such drivel.

57:10.176 --> 57:12.512
You plagiarized the song
written by Se-yeon and Leo.

57:13.680 --> 57:17.684
I checked everything with the producer.
I was told it was on Mr. Lee's orders.

57:17.767 --> 57:19.394
Why are you taking things this far?

57:19.477 --> 57:22.355
Is there a reason why you don't welcome
Se-yeon's tribute album?

57:26.359 --> 57:27.485
Plagiarism?

57:28.236 --> 57:30.864
Why cause a scene over a song
that wasn't even copyrighted?

57:30.947 --> 57:32.115
Let's be honest.

57:32.198 --> 57:34.742
Even if Jeong Se-yeon or Leo
were to make a fuss over it,

57:34.826 --> 57:36.453
who's going to believe them?

57:37.120 --> 57:39.539
- Excuse me?
- Unless you want to lose your job,

57:40.123 --> 57:44.544
you better shut your mouth
and quietly do your job, Ms. Lim.

57:44.627 --> 57:46.087
Don't cause unnecessary ruckus.

57:53.803 --> 57:55.972
What? What kind of bastard…

57:56.055 --> 57:57.056
Darn it.

57:59.476 --> 58:00.643
Hi, Reporter Choi.

58:01.394 --> 58:04.147
Yes, of course.
I've sent you the publicity materials.

58:04.731 --> 58:05.565
Right.

58:05.648 --> 58:06.608
Wait.

58:07.108 --> 58:08.651
I have something to ask.

58:08.735 --> 58:10.904
It's about Se-yeon's
school bullying article.

58:11.654 --> 58:13.198
Yes. That's it.

58:24.667 --> 58:26.920
Should I tell him how I feel
when I give him this?

58:27.003 --> 58:28.421
I'm meeting with Soo-ho later.

58:35.220 --> 58:36.429
What is this?

58:38.264 --> 58:39.098
Darn it.

58:41.434 --> 58:45.480
HEY, JU-KYUNG

58:47.482 --> 58:49.359
Am I in the wrong to be upset?

59:00.537 --> 59:01.454
Who is it?

59:04.457 --> 59:05.875
Why are you here at this hour?

59:05.959 --> 59:07.544
Goodness. It's so cold in here.

59:07.627 --> 59:10.755
You don't use your heater, do you?
I told you to use it.

59:11.923 --> 59:13.007
It's so heavy.

59:13.967 --> 59:15.051
What is it?

59:15.134 --> 59:17.512
I asked my mom
and got you some side dishes.

59:17.595 --> 59:21.224
Your dad asked me to take care of you,
so I can't just pretend not to have heard.

59:21.307 --> 59:22.433
You didn't have to.

59:23.268 --> 59:24.477
I rarely eat at home.

59:24.561 --> 59:27.480
There's gratitude for you.
Just throw away the leftovers.

59:29.649 --> 59:30.567
Are you not leaving?

59:31.734 --> 59:33.069
Gosh, you're heartless.

59:33.152 --> 59:35.572
It's been a while since I visited
and you don't even offer me water?

59:37.490 --> 59:38.324
Typical.

59:40.034 --> 59:42.370
How has nothing changed here?

59:44.622 --> 59:46.332
That painting's still here?

59:55.008 --> 59:56.843
GIRLFRIEND

01:00:05.977 --> 01:00:07.604
- Hey…
- Hello?

01:00:18.531 --> 01:00:19.782
Drink this and leave.

01:00:24.287 --> 01:00:25.997
Relax, I'm not moving in here.

01:00:29.334 --> 01:00:30.335
Here.

01:00:31.377 --> 01:00:32.462
What's this?

01:00:32.545 --> 01:00:34.589
A gift. I'm not sure if you'll like it.

01:00:34.672 --> 01:00:35.798
What is this for?

01:00:35.882 --> 01:00:37.342
Well, as a thank you.

01:00:37.425 --> 01:00:40.053
Just take it.
Am I not even allowed to get you a gift?

01:00:48.561 --> 01:00:50.938
We've never exchanged gifts
to thank each other.

01:00:51.022 --> 01:00:52.482
And you came here just for this?

01:00:53.107 --> 01:00:53.941
At this hour?

01:00:54.692 --> 01:00:56.402
I'm not here just to give you this.

01:00:57.236 --> 01:00:58.738
I came here because I missed you.

01:01:01.449 --> 01:01:02.617
Lately, I've begun…

01:01:03.785 --> 01:01:04.994
to care about you.

01:01:07.664 --> 01:01:08.998
I can't accept it then.

01:01:10.541 --> 01:01:11.459
You should keep it.

01:01:11.542 --> 01:01:14.170
Why? You don't like it?
Should I get it exchanged?

01:01:14.253 --> 01:01:15.505
I have a girlfriend.

01:01:17.465 --> 01:01:18.383
And?

01:01:19.676 --> 01:01:20.843
So what?

01:01:21.594 --> 01:01:22.470
Well…

01:01:25.098 --> 01:01:26.474
Come on.

01:01:26.557 --> 01:01:28.851
One might think
I said I have feelings for you.

01:01:29.519 --> 01:01:30.770
Why are you overreacting?

01:01:30.853 --> 01:01:33.022
Anyway, you have a girlfriend? Who is it?

01:01:33.106 --> 01:01:34.273
I'll tell you later.

01:01:35.400 --> 01:01:37.110
It's getting late. Go home now.

01:02:05.304 --> 01:02:07.515
KANG.S.J. UPLOADED A NEW PICTURE

01:02:25.158 --> 01:02:28.035
BOYFRIEND

01:02:35.209 --> 01:02:36.377
Hello?

01:02:37.128 --> 01:02:38.045
Hi.

01:02:38.796 --> 01:02:39.630
It's me.

01:02:40.840 --> 01:02:41.716
Hey.

01:02:43.551 --> 01:02:44.552
Did I wake you?

01:02:46.596 --> 01:02:47.472
No.

01:02:49.640 --> 01:02:51.434
What have you been up to?

01:02:51.517 --> 01:02:52.518
Nothing.

01:02:54.228 --> 01:02:55.563
I've just been at home.

01:03:01.694 --> 01:03:02.779
Earlier at school…

01:03:02.862 --> 01:03:04.906
I'm a little tired. Let's talk tomorrow.

01:03:05.573 --> 01:03:06.657
Hanging up now.

01:03:20.463 --> 01:03:25.051
GIRLFRIEND

01:03:26.177 --> 01:03:27.178
Good night.

01:03:35.686 --> 01:03:36.979
Your coffee is ready.

01:03:51.536 --> 01:03:52.662
Ju-kyung.

01:03:53.371 --> 01:03:54.956
Hey, I'm not in the mood.

01:03:55.873 --> 01:03:56.707
I'm sorry.

01:04:01.546 --> 01:04:04.131
- I said, stop.
- "I said, stop."

01:04:05.508 --> 01:04:07.343
- Come on, stop it.
- "Come on, stop it."

01:04:09.178 --> 01:04:11.430
- What's with you today?
- Smile a little.

01:04:21.148 --> 01:04:22.024
Why are you here?

01:04:22.108 --> 01:04:23.442
Am I not allowed here?

01:04:25.611 --> 01:04:27.154
You said he was filling in that day,

01:04:27.238 --> 01:04:28.197
yet here he is again.

01:04:28.990 --> 01:04:31.659
The boss asked him to come.
The other part-timer quit.

01:04:31.742 --> 01:04:33.452
Your boyfriend runs a tight ship.

01:04:34.203 --> 01:04:36.372
- I feel like being interrogated.
- Can we talk?

01:04:36.455 --> 01:04:37.790
I'm working right now.

01:04:37.874 --> 01:04:39.041
Then I'll wait.

01:04:40.334 --> 01:04:41.377
Something cold, please.

01:04:42.086 --> 01:04:43.713
You're going to sit and watch us?

01:04:43.796 --> 01:04:44.881
This is obsessive.

01:04:44.964 --> 01:04:46.966
This is about us. You stay out of it.

01:04:47.758 --> 01:04:49.886
I'll let you know when I'm done.

01:04:49.969 --> 01:04:51.971
- Am I bothering you?
- No, it's not that…

01:04:55.266 --> 01:04:56.100
All right.

01:04:56.642 --> 01:04:57.935
I'll wait outside.

01:04:58.644 --> 01:04:59.979
Let me know when you're done.

01:05:10.364 --> 01:05:11.240
You should just go.

01:05:12.116 --> 01:05:13.034
What?

01:05:13.743 --> 01:05:16.370
- I couldn't do that.
- It's not busy today, so I'll manage.

01:05:17.663 --> 01:05:19.749
So go have a fight or make up with him.

01:05:19.832 --> 01:05:21.709
Don't make me feel uncomfortable as well.

01:05:22.710 --> 01:05:23.711
I'm sorry.

01:05:41.103 --> 01:05:42.855
I want to get my eyes done.

01:05:42.939 --> 01:05:45.566
No. Then your eyes wouldn't look as sexy.

01:05:45.650 --> 01:05:47.443
- My eyes look sexy?
- Yes, they do.

01:05:47.526 --> 01:05:49.028
- Really.
- My cheekbones, then?

01:05:49.111 --> 01:05:51.530
- No. Then you won't look as cute.
- Gosh.

01:05:51.614 --> 01:05:54.367
Then, the back corner of my eyes?
Then what would I lose?

01:05:56.661 --> 01:05:57.620
Welcome.

01:05:57.703 --> 01:05:59.622
- Hi, Han Seo-jun.
- Hi.

01:06:02.083 --> 01:06:04.710
- Lee Sung-yong's girlfriend.
- I broke up with him long ago.

01:06:04.794 --> 01:06:05.878
- They broke up.
- They broke up.

01:06:05.962 --> 01:06:06.796
Just order.

01:06:06.879 --> 01:06:09.090
- I want something light.
- Try the avocado.

01:06:10.466 --> 01:06:12.301
I came to give you this.

01:06:15.429 --> 01:06:16.597
I thought I lost this.

01:06:18.474 --> 01:06:19.600
How did you get this?

01:06:20.184 --> 01:06:22.228
I did you a favor.
What's with the attitude?

01:06:23.062 --> 01:06:23.938
By the way,

01:06:24.563 --> 01:06:25.982
the girl who just walked out.

01:06:26.065 --> 01:06:28.401
She's Lim Ju-kyung
from Saebom High School, right?

01:06:28.484 --> 01:06:29.610
- Lim Ju-kyung?
- Lim Ju-kyung?

01:06:30.403 --> 01:06:31.737
So what if she is?

01:06:32.697 --> 01:06:33.531
Nothing.

01:06:34.031 --> 01:06:35.074
I'm just asking.

01:06:35.992 --> 01:06:37.118
Do you work with her?

01:06:37.201 --> 01:06:38.327
Are you going to order?

01:06:38.411 --> 01:06:39.286
One affocato.

01:06:39.370 --> 01:06:40.788
Give her an avocado, please.

01:06:40.871 --> 01:06:42.581
It's called an "affogato."

01:06:42.665 --> 01:06:44.625
- Affocato.
- It's avocado.

01:06:54.802 --> 01:06:55.720
Hey.

01:06:57.138 --> 01:06:58.597
What did you want to talk about?

01:06:58.681 --> 01:06:59.807
Let's tell people…

01:07:00.850 --> 01:07:02.351
that we're dating.

01:07:03.060 --> 01:07:04.103
I'm going to tell them.

01:07:04.186 --> 01:07:05.312
Why all of a sudden?

01:07:05.396 --> 01:07:07.106
I don't want to hide it anymore.

01:07:07.189 --> 01:07:08.649
You said it was okay.

01:07:09.525 --> 01:07:10.359
Why?

01:07:11.444 --> 01:07:12.361
You don't want to?

01:07:13.612 --> 01:07:14.488
I'm still…

01:07:15.740 --> 01:07:17.033
not comfortable with it.

01:07:17.116 --> 01:07:19.827
So you're uncomfortable
with people knowing about us,

01:07:19.910 --> 01:07:21.787
but okay with people thinking
you're with Seo-jun?

01:07:21.871 --> 01:07:22.872
That's not what I meant.

01:07:22.955 --> 01:07:24.832
If you two have to keep working together,

01:07:25.624 --> 01:07:26.876
you should quit your job.

01:07:26.959 --> 01:07:28.335
Why should I do that?

01:07:28.419 --> 01:07:29.462
Because I don't like it.

01:07:29.545 --> 01:07:31.547
I don't like you two talking,

01:07:31.630 --> 01:07:33.132
much less locking eyes.

01:07:33.215 --> 01:07:35.134
That's a problem between you two, not me.

01:07:35.217 --> 01:07:36.218
Exactly.

01:07:36.302 --> 01:07:38.888
You know how things are,
so why do you still hang out with him?

01:07:38.971 --> 01:07:41.640
So I can't have friends or a job
without your approval?

01:07:42.141 --> 01:07:44.435
Then can you drop anything
that I don't approve of?

01:07:44.518 --> 01:07:46.187
Even throw away your friends?

01:07:46.270 --> 01:07:47.229
What if I can?

01:07:49.231 --> 01:07:51.108
Must be nice for it to be so easy.

01:07:55.237 --> 01:07:56.155
Then if I told you…

01:07:56.947 --> 01:07:58.783
I can't tell people we're dating

01:07:59.658 --> 01:08:02.161
and I can't quit my job, what then?

01:08:03.788 --> 01:08:04.830
What?

01:08:05.498 --> 01:08:06.999
Then we can't see each other?

01:08:08.417 --> 01:08:09.919
What is that supposed to mean?

01:08:14.799 --> 01:08:15.800
Ju-kyung.

01:08:15.883 --> 01:08:16.801
Ju-kyung!

01:08:57.842 --> 01:08:59.343
Welcome home, Ju-kyung.

01:09:48.851 --> 01:09:51.395
Hey, those rookies
from Move Entertainment debuted today.

01:09:51.478 --> 01:09:52.938
But they changed the title song.

01:09:53.022 --> 01:09:55.149
It's totally different
from the highlight they released.

01:09:55.232 --> 01:09:57.359
Really? That's crazy. Let me hear it.

01:10:00.654 --> 01:10:01.864
Nice.

01:10:01.947 --> 01:10:02.823
I like this better.

01:10:02.907 --> 01:10:04.200
So cool, right?

01:10:04.825 --> 01:10:06.869
They're good-looking.

01:10:12.958 --> 01:10:16.170
MOVE ENTERTAINMENT'S BLACK SOUL
WITH THEIR DEBUT RELEASE "STARLIGHT"

01:10:30.559 --> 01:10:31.435
The person you are…

01:10:41.278 --> 01:10:43.197
I like the cool and chic vibe. One, two!

01:10:43.280 --> 01:10:44.990
Okay, I'll get closer. Two!

01:10:45.074 --> 01:10:46.492
All right, three.

01:10:47.409 --> 01:10:50.287
That's nice. I love it.

01:10:50.371 --> 01:10:52.331
One, two. Shift a bit.

01:10:53.165 --> 01:10:54.375
That's it.

01:10:56.335 --> 01:10:59.421
All right, Seo-jun, that looks nice.

01:11:02.925 --> 01:11:03.926
Okay.

01:11:04.510 --> 01:11:06.011
Yes, more.

01:11:08.097 --> 01:11:09.431
What the heck?

01:11:14.770 --> 01:11:15.980
- Jeez.
- What is it?

01:11:16.063 --> 01:11:17.898
Hey, where are you going? Han Seo-jun!

01:11:24.238 --> 01:11:26.198
- What can I do for…
- Is Mr. Lee in?

01:11:28.033 --> 01:11:29.243
Okay, understood.

01:11:29.326 --> 01:11:30.286
Sir.

01:11:30.369 --> 01:11:33.122
- What is it?
- Did you really have to take it this far?

01:11:33.789 --> 01:11:37.126
- Ms. Lim, what do you think you're doing?
- I get why you wouldn't like it.

01:11:37.209 --> 01:11:39.962
People talking about Se-yeon again.

01:11:40.879 --> 01:11:44.800
But still, you'd steal a song from him
just to hide your own wrongdoing?

01:11:47.636 --> 01:11:48.637
What is she saying?

01:11:48.721 --> 01:11:50.014
It's nothing, sir.

01:11:52.057 --> 01:11:55.311
Do you think he has time to deal
with every new artist?

01:11:55.394 --> 01:11:56.812
Come on. Let's talk outside.

01:11:56.895 --> 01:11:59.231
Let go. I said, let go of me!

01:12:10.284 --> 01:12:12.953
Just to hide a picture of you
taken with a young actress,

01:12:13.037 --> 01:12:14.913
you ran stories about Se-yeon's bullying.

01:12:15.998 --> 01:12:18.917
If you actually felt bad
for Se-yeon's death,

01:12:19.001 --> 01:12:20.502
you shouldn't have done this.

01:12:21.295 --> 01:12:24.423
Even if the copyright isn't registered,
this is clearly plagiarism!

01:12:26.675 --> 01:12:30.304
How dare you come into my office
and speak such nonsense!

01:12:31.347 --> 01:12:32.181
Get her out.

01:12:33.515 --> 01:12:34.350
Get out!

01:12:34.433 --> 01:12:37.811
Se-yeon and Leo are only 18.

01:12:37.895 --> 01:12:40.022
You even have a son yourself.

01:12:40.105 --> 01:12:42.983
If you feel even the slightest guilt
toward kids your son's age,

01:12:43.067 --> 01:12:45.069
take the song down and make things right.

01:12:46.487 --> 01:12:48.614
Rather than having it revealed
by my whistleblowing,

01:12:48.697 --> 01:12:50.783
it would look much better
if you dealt with it yourself.

01:12:55.329 --> 01:12:56.163
So,

01:12:56.997 --> 01:12:58.665
are you blackmailing me?

01:12:59.917 --> 01:13:01.627
Think of it however you want.

01:13:02.252 --> 01:13:04.463
I said what I said, at the risk of my job.

01:13:04.546 --> 01:13:06.507
Get out. Have you gone mad?

01:13:06.590 --> 01:13:08.467
I'll get out myself.

01:13:25.567 --> 01:13:26.402
Soo-ho.

01:13:30.864 --> 01:13:31.865
Soo-ho.

01:14:01.228 --> 01:14:02.396
Hey, Lee Soo-ho!

01:14:03.063 --> 01:14:04.231
Did you hear?

01:14:04.314 --> 01:14:06.066
The new song that came out from Move--

01:14:07.359 --> 01:14:08.402
That punk.

01:14:08.485 --> 01:14:09.319
Hey!

01:14:09.820 --> 01:14:10.946
Lee Soo-ho!

01:15:21.433 --> 01:15:23.894
What's wrong with me?

01:15:23.977 --> 01:15:25.771
Things keep getting messed up,

01:15:26.355 --> 01:15:28.815
and I end up hurting people
for no good reason.

01:15:30.359 --> 01:15:32.528
There's someone called
Lim Ju-kyung at your school.

01:15:33.278 --> 01:15:35.405
Why did you do that? That was nothing!

01:15:35.489 --> 01:15:38.325
- Soo-ho!
- Do you know how much I suffered?

01:15:38.408 --> 01:15:40.160
I came to give you a hug.

01:15:41.245 --> 01:15:43.539
Why didn't you tell me back then?

01:15:44.414 --> 01:15:45.874
Lim Ju-kyung!

01:15:45.958 --> 01:15:47.626
She transferred from Yongpa High School.

01:15:49.586 --> 01:15:54.591
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
